WEBVTT

01:37.880 --> 01:40.630
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.320 --> 01:43.610
[Episode 35]

02:01.280 --> 02:02.210
I'm Lu Qianqiao.

02:03.230 --> 02:04.090
What happened?

02:06.560 --> 02:07.490
Qinghong Sect's

02:07.840 --> 02:08.900
Lord Baori is here.

02:12.280 --> 02:13.680
Behind the Qinghong Sect

02:14.280 --> 02:15.880
is indeed the Tianyuan Sect.

02:36.150 --> 02:39.460
♪ Hear the Gu curse
turn into cries for help ♪

02:39.520 --> 02:43.430
♪ Blood-stained hand, sword drawn ♪

02:43.460 --> 02:46.930
♪ Trapped in Qianyan Cave ♪

02:46.960 --> 02:50.430
♪ Even hell must be broken free from ♪

02:51.560 --> 02:54.740
♪ With every stroke of hatred ♪

02:52.240 --> 02:52.960
Take it off.

02:54.760 --> 02:58.780
♪ Let it grow into a dagger I wear ♪

02:56.630 --> 02:57.400
Take it off.

02:58.800 --> 03:01.040
♪ No need to show me mercy there ♪

03:01.070 --> 03:04.900
♪ Let me take every blow ♪

03:06.520 --> 03:10.620
♪ Drag my wounds through the hollow road ♪

03:10.650 --> 03:13.930
♪ I'll pluck the passion
locked in my brow ♪

03:13.950 --> 03:17.320
♪ At the end of the mountains,
I pick up fireflies now ♪

03:17.340 --> 03:21.490
♪ Burn me down, I feel no pain ♪

03:21.530 --> 03:23.120
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪

03:23.140 --> 03:25.410
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

03:25.590 --> 03:28.970
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

03:29.130 --> 03:30.650
♪ I believe I'm innocent ♪

03:30.680 --> 03:35.980
♪ Turned into dust and scattered away ♪

03:36.730 --> 03:38.310
♪ I accept the blame of
numerous accusations ♪

03:38.329 --> 03:40.790
♪ I offer no defense ♪

03:40.820 --> 03:44.290
♪ I accept this as my only choice ♪

03:44.320 --> 03:45.960
♪ I admit my heart
is as hard as iron and stone ♪

03:45.980 --> 03:48.260
♪ Call me cold if you must ♪

03:48.390 --> 03:51.010
♪ Until I die ♪

03:51.550 --> 03:54.760
♪ I accept this trial of love
fate has given me ♪

03:54.940 --> 03:59.370
♪ I take in both love and hate alike ♪

04:06.630 --> 04:08.030
She can't hold on any longer.

04:08.030 --> 04:09.000
Go get the medicine!

04:09.000 --> 04:09.860
What medicine?

04:10.400 --> 04:11.590
The medicine
in the medicine box downstairs.

04:11.590 --> 04:12.560
Bring every last one of them,

04:12.560 --> 04:13.150
all without exception!

04:13.150 --> 04:13.430
Hurry!

04:13.430 --> 04:13.800
Okay.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.040
Who is there?

05:06.850 --> 05:11.420
[In Perfect Safety]

06:14.750 --> 06:15.550
Young Master,

06:15.950 --> 06:17.000
you're dressed so thinly.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.130
Are you heading out?

06:18.160 --> 06:19.310
I'm waiting for someone.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.510
Waiting for someone?

06:24.070 --> 06:25.730
Are you waiting for your wife?

06:29.190 --> 06:30.810
This manor has fallen into
disrepair over the years.

06:30.810 --> 06:32.430
Only passing travelers and hunters

06:32.430 --> 06:33.680
take shelter here
from the rain temporarily.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.740
It's cold outside.

06:34.750 --> 06:36.040
Don't catch a cold.

07:07.630 --> 07:08.430
Young Master,

07:08.430 --> 07:09.390
you're still here.

07:09.390 --> 07:10.850
Hasn't your wife come yet?

07:13.830 --> 07:14.890
Go inside and wait.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.070
Don't get wet.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.310
Senior.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.530
You're finally awake.

08:08.360 --> 08:08.950
Sheng,

08:10.430 --> 08:12.090
what happened to you that day?

08:13.040 --> 08:14.580
You went completely obsessed.

08:14.580 --> 08:15.910
You lost consciousness

08:16.040 --> 08:17.770
and just kept lashing out at me.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.780
I barely managed to wake you up

08:19.800 --> 08:22.120
with
the Seven-Star Acupoint Extraction Art.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.120
Then I passed out.

08:23.510 --> 08:25.040
I don't remember anything.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.870
What exactly happened,

08:28.870 --> 08:29.390
Sheng?

08:31.000 --> 08:31.680
Senior,

08:32.470 --> 08:33.200
I'm fine.

08:33.909 --> 08:35.169
Give me a few more days,

08:35.360 --> 08:37.020
and I'll solve my own problem.

08:37.150 --> 08:38.280
Don't overthink it.

08:38.750 --> 08:40.679
Just focus on recuperating, okay?

08:48.790 --> 08:49.840
How did I advance?

08:50.670 --> 08:53.000
How come I have the power
of the Void Stage?

08:55.390 --> 08:55.960
Sheng.

08:57.510 --> 08:59.370
I saved you with the golden lotus.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.500
What golden lotus?

09:01.670 --> 09:03.670
Jin Lun's soul-bound golden lotus.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.100
Your life was at stake.

09:05.360 --> 09:07.760
Only the golden lotus
could save your life.

09:07.790 --> 09:09.190
It's just a golden lotus.

09:09.510 --> 09:10.770
It's nothing serious.

09:11.220 --> 09:12.200
Even without the golden lotus,

09:12.200 --> 09:13.600
Jin Lun can still live on.

09:13.910 --> 09:14.600
Doesn't Tianyin Mountain

09:14.600 --> 09:16.070
always claim to deliver all living beings

09:16.070 --> 09:18.150
and cherish every creature under heaven?

09:18.150 --> 09:19.480
Have you lost your mind?

09:19.670 --> 09:20.480
Do you know

09:20.480 --> 09:21.740
you'll get him killed?

09:23.320 --> 09:24.580
You owe him such a debt,

09:25.190 --> 09:26.590
such a bond of affection—

09:27.080 --> 09:28.610
how will you ever repay him?

09:29.080 --> 09:31.140
I can't worry about all that anymore.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.510
Senior,

09:33.270 --> 09:34.200
the debt I owe him

09:35.240 --> 09:36.670
is far beyond repayment.

10:01.910 --> 10:02.640
Sect Master.

10:04.120 --> 10:04.720
What is it?

10:05.080 --> 10:07.340
Senior Bai committed suicide in prison.

10:35.320 --> 10:36.920
The wound has been bandaged.

10:38.270 --> 10:39.620
They know their place well enough

10:39.620 --> 10:41.480
and have shown you no disrespect.

10:42.670 --> 10:43.440
Why?

10:44.000 --> 10:45.550
Why is that?

10:46.910 --> 10:48.770
You cut your wrist to lure me here,

10:49.510 --> 10:50.910
just to ask me why?

10:56.150 --> 10:56.910
Fine.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.960
I'll tell you.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.320
Back then,

11:01.720 --> 11:04.670
when I first reached
the Deity Transformation Stage,

11:04.670 --> 11:05.720
I had

11:05.720 --> 11:06.840
a horrible dream.

11:08.150 --> 11:08.810
In my dream,

11:09.720 --> 11:11.320
I walked on the street alone.

11:11.720 --> 11:14.180
Tall buildings lined
both sides of the road.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.880
On the wide streets,

11:16.120 --> 11:17.670
small wooden carts

11:17.670 --> 11:18.400
raced along.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.270
They needed no one to push them,

11:21.270 --> 11:22.600
nor horses to draw them,

11:22.630 --> 11:24.560
yet they raced as swift as the wind.

11:25.670 --> 11:26.960
I lifted my head.

11:28.530 --> 11:29.650
Gigantic airships

11:29.680 --> 11:31.010
drifted across the sky,

11:31.630 --> 11:32.960
swooping past above me,

11:34.390 --> 11:36.520
as if about to blot out the sun and moon.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.200
I had never seen

11:38.200 --> 11:39.330
such a sight before.

11:40.000 --> 11:42.000
Merely crafted from a few planks of wood,

11:42.000 --> 11:42.910
they wielded power

11:42.910 --> 11:44.360
rivaling that of gods.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.550
I walked onward,

11:52.390 --> 11:54.590
yet my heart grew increasingly uneasy.

11:55.600 --> 11:57.790
The ability to traverse heaven and earth

11:57.790 --> 11:59.030
was meant to be the power

11:59.030 --> 12:00.830
only we cultivators possessed.

12:00.910 --> 12:02.640
How is it that they all wield it?

12:04.240 --> 12:06.640
Where then does that leave us cultivators?

12:06.840 --> 12:09.030
I searched and looked for
them desperately.

12:09.030 --> 12:09.630
In the end,

12:10.630 --> 12:12.090
I found that in this world,

12:13.630 --> 12:15.830
there was not a single cultivator left.

12:16.910 --> 12:18.840
Not a single cultivator left, Bai.

12:19.030 --> 12:20.090
Aren't you afraid?

12:20.320 --> 12:22.120
Where were all the cultivators?

12:25.120 --> 12:26.000
But you should not

12:26.000 --> 12:27.200
exterminate them all

12:28.270 --> 12:30.730
for something
that hasn't even come to pass.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.790
The "Unparalleled Secret Magic"

12:32.790 --> 12:34.590
is no demonic or forbidden arts.

12:35.030 --> 12:36.230
It's Craftsmanship,

12:36.600 --> 12:38.060
Astronomy, and Calendar,

12:38.600 --> 12:39.440
the very knowledge

12:39.440 --> 12:41.870
that can prosper and strengthen
the Human Race.

12:41.870 --> 12:42.730
You're afraid.

12:43.360 --> 12:46.150
You're afraid that the Human Race
will become stronger.

12:46.150 --> 12:46.870
But don't cultivators

12:46.870 --> 12:48.270
belong to the Human Race?

12:49.390 --> 12:50.990
We share the same bloodline.

12:51.200 --> 12:52.800
We have the same appearance,

12:53.080 --> 12:54.270
language,

12:54.630 --> 12:55.690
and civilization.

12:55.840 --> 12:57.080
We're one.

12:57.150 --> 12:57.550
No.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.340
We are better than them

13:00.390 --> 13:02.120
and stronger than them as well.

13:02.960 --> 13:03.600
Bai,

13:04.150 --> 13:04.840
do you know

13:05.630 --> 13:07.080
what the most similar animal

13:07.080 --> 13:08.210
to the Human Race is?

13:09.870 --> 13:10.670
It's a monkey.

13:12.630 --> 13:13.630
You must have seen those

13:13.630 --> 13:16.120
monkey entertainers wandering the streets.

13:16.120 --> 13:17.580
Trained by their masters,

13:17.650 --> 13:18.320
those monkeys

13:18.320 --> 13:20.380
can not only understand human speech

13:20.950 --> 13:22.430
but even learn to count

13:22.790 --> 13:23.390
and dance.

13:24.120 --> 13:25.670
Yet in the eyes of humans,

13:25.910 --> 13:27.640
aren't they still mere beasts?

13:28.910 --> 13:30.960
We are born with immortal perceptions

13:30.960 --> 13:33.020
and are inherently superior to them.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.510
Hypocritical pretense,

13:38.120 --> 13:39.780
nothing but absurd nonsense.

13:44.280 --> 13:45.940
When I first entered the sect,

13:47.390 --> 13:48.510
you once told me

13:49.150 --> 13:50.000
cultivators

13:50.440 --> 13:52.370
shall take the world as their duty,

13:53.070 --> 13:55.510
and uphold righteousness
and banish demons as their calling.

13:55.510 --> 13:57.440
Even at the cost of their own lives,

13:57.600 --> 14:00.400
they must protect
all living beings under heaven.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.030
Yet what you do now

14:03.080 --> 14:05.140
bears not the slightest resemblance

14:05.360 --> 14:06.630
to what you once said.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.720
The Tianyuan Sect

14:11.270 --> 14:13.000
is the foremost leader
of the righteous path,

14:13.000 --> 14:14.390
a Taoist sect standing for 100 years,

14:14.390 --> 14:15.910
revered by all under heaven

14:15.910 --> 14:17.960
and worshipped by countless mortals.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.220
Yet who could ever know

14:19.630 --> 14:20.910
beneath that immortal,

14:20.910 --> 14:21.790
saintly guise

14:22.150 --> 14:24.360
lurks a heart long rotten

14:24.790 --> 14:26.520
and crawling with corruption—

14:27.440 --> 14:28.550
utterly hideous

14:30.930 --> 14:32.330
and repulsive.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.000
Bai,

14:37.080 --> 14:37.840
you are

14:39.030 --> 14:41.630
the disciple in whom I place
the highest hopes.

14:41.790 --> 14:42.390
For you are

14:43.960 --> 14:45.160
truly so much like me.

14:47.270 --> 14:48.480
I was once young too

14:49.200 --> 14:51.530
and once burned with the passion of youth.

14:51.620 --> 14:52.720
Back then, the War Demon

14:52.720 --> 14:54.000
launched the Battle of Pinghu

14:54.000 --> 14:56.120
to hasten the growth
of the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder.

14:56.120 --> 14:57.480
The Twelve Immortal Sects

14:57.480 --> 14:58.550
allied with the Youhu Clan

14:58.550 --> 15:00.150
to fight against the War Demons.

15:00.150 --> 15:01.960
Three of our sect's
tribulation-crossing elders

15:01.960 --> 15:03.080
chose to seclude themselves
behind closed doors,

15:03.080 --> 15:04.700
refusing to join the battlefield.

15:04.700 --> 15:06.350
Only my brothers and I

15:08.200 --> 15:10.060
rushed forth, risking our lives.

15:11.000 --> 15:11.720
Why?

15:13.240 --> 15:14.770
When I returned to the sect,

15:16.360 --> 15:17.510
I once asked the very same question

15:17.510 --> 15:18.240
you do now.

15:18.240 --> 15:18.910
Why?

15:19.360 --> 15:20.150
They could wield the power

15:20.150 --> 15:20.940
to traverse heaven and earth,

15:20.940 --> 15:22.390
but why did they refuse to lend a hand,

15:22.390 --> 15:24.750
standing by and watching
as the sect's disciples

15:24.750 --> 15:25.950
perished one and all?

15:27.000 --> 15:27.930
Yet they claimed

15:29.240 --> 15:30.970
that staying away from the fray

15:31.000 --> 15:33.260
was the greatest help they could give us.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.480
Many years later,

15:38.000 --> 15:39.260
I finally understood.

15:39.910 --> 15:41.000
Had they joined

15:41.000 --> 15:42.730
the Battle of Pinghu back then,

15:44.000 --> 15:45.040
they would most likely

15:45.040 --> 15:46.840
have lost control of themselves

15:47.110 --> 15:48.770
and sided with the War Demons.

15:49.150 --> 15:49.810
For they too

15:51.600 --> 15:53.240
craved immortality—

15:55.030 --> 15:56.240
a temptation

15:57.080 --> 15:58.910
even they could not resist.

16:00.120 --> 16:00.750
Back then,

16:02.570 --> 16:04.910
I once severed the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder
with my own hand.

16:04.910 --> 16:06.000
I thought I had won.

16:06.510 --> 16:08.440
Yet only today do I finally realize

16:09.080 --> 16:10.140
that what I severed

16:11.320 --> 16:13.920
was not merely
the War Demons' path of survival

16:14.510 --> 16:17.040
but also the very lifeline
of us cultivators.

16:17.600 --> 16:18.800
What do you want to do?

16:27.570 --> 16:28.920
You want to rebuild the heavenly ladder?

16:28.920 --> 16:30.670
Ninefold palace realms
and blessed immortal abodes

16:30.670 --> 16:32.030
are where we belong!

16:32.390 --> 16:33.840
Born with immortal perceptions,

16:33.840 --> 16:35.440
we ought to ride the wind and soar,

16:35.440 --> 16:37.390
treading the boundless starry sky
and vast rivers and mountains

16:37.390 --> 16:38.390
beneath our feet,

16:38.440 --> 16:40.840
instead of lingering in this narrow realm,

16:41.550 --> 16:43.080
wasting away until our end.

16:45.240 --> 16:46.120
Are you crazy?

16:47.120 --> 16:48.720
I think you're really crazy.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.550
Bai,

16:53.750 --> 16:55.680
this is a struggle of the great Dao,

16:55.910 --> 16:57.370
a clash of civilizations,

16:58.440 --> 17:00.440
and above all, a fight for survival.

17:00.790 --> 17:01.790
One day,

17:02.390 --> 17:03.790
you will understand me.

17:05.609 --> 17:06.869
I won't kill you today.

17:07.349 --> 17:09.010
But if you wish to die again...

17:13.790 --> 17:14.829
I won't stop you.

18:11.750 --> 18:12.810
You guessed right.

18:14.270 --> 18:14.930
Where is it?

18:15.270 --> 18:16.000
If it exists,

18:18.590 --> 18:20.590
it must be at the Rainwatch Terrace.

18:45.200 --> 18:45.830
The Jianmu Tree is a spirit

18:45.830 --> 18:47.230
born of heaven and earth.

18:47.780 --> 18:49.110
To hasten its maturity,

18:49.270 --> 18:51.070
it requires immense resources.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.720
At the heart of the desolate wasteland,

18:52.720 --> 18:54.180
where the springs run dry,

18:54.400 --> 18:55.930
there lies the Jianmu Tree.

18:56.970 --> 19:06.630
[Tianyuan Sect]

19:04.920 --> 19:05.790
Does it look like

19:05.790 --> 19:06.850
it's going to rain?

19:06.960 --> 19:07.920
Rain?

19:13.240 --> 19:14.570
Don't get your hopes up.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.350
I was wondering

19:44.960 --> 19:46.550
you'd fear me so much

19:46.790 --> 19:48.520
as to walk straight into a trap.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.270
So you really came here for it after all.

19:59.270 --> 20:00.730
Back at the Qinghong Sect,

20:00.920 --> 20:01.720
Fan asked me to help him

20:01.720 --> 20:03.400
translate the War Demons' scroll.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.660
Now it all makes sense—

20:04.790 --> 20:06.450
it was meant for you all along.

20:06.640 --> 20:07.640
Why have you secretly been nurturing

20:07.640 --> 20:09.200
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree?

20:09.200 --> 20:10.800
You want to ascend to the sky?

20:11.000 --> 20:11.960
Not just me.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.400
Who among all the immortal sects

20:14.400 --> 20:15.720
and cultivators in this world

20:15.720 --> 20:16.920
would not long for it?

20:17.750 --> 20:19.680
Don't you want to ascend to the sky?

20:19.720 --> 20:20.830
You're a War Demon.

20:21.160 --> 20:22.360
Others may refuse it,

20:22.480 --> 20:23.920
but you should long for it
more than anyone.

20:23.920 --> 20:24.790
How can you be so certain

20:24.790 --> 20:26.030
that there are none of your own kind

20:26.030 --> 20:26.960
left in this world,

20:26.960 --> 20:28.030
lingering on in desperate survival

20:28.030 --> 20:29.830
and living a life just like yours?

20:29.830 --> 20:31.400
Do you not long to ascend to the sky

20:31.400 --> 20:32.470
to beg the deities above

20:32.470 --> 20:33.930
to lift the curse upon you?

20:34.110 --> 20:35.350
And then ask them—

20:35.840 --> 20:37.310
why cast you down into the mortal world

20:37.310 --> 20:38.870
and abandon you without a care,

20:38.870 --> 20:42.030
letting you live a life
of utter humiliation and degradation?

20:42.030 --> 20:42.720
But I will never

20:42.720 --> 20:43.590
pave my own way

20:43.920 --> 20:45.780
at the cost of the lives of others.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.110
How hypocritical.

20:48.350 --> 20:49.610
Do you not understand?

20:49.640 --> 20:50.960
Whether it be the War Demons,

20:50.960 --> 20:52.030
the Youhu Clan,

20:52.440 --> 20:54.100
or the Twelve Immortal Sects,

20:54.550 --> 20:56.750
all who cultivate with spiritual energy,

20:56.750 --> 20:58.440
we are of the same kind.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.200
The same kind?

21:02.880 --> 21:04.280
For the clothes you wear,

21:04.310 --> 21:06.070
silkworm farmers need
to tend silkworms with great care

21:06.070 --> 21:07.000
to reel raw silk,

21:07.110 --> 21:08.030
and weavers need

21:08.030 --> 21:09.160
to spend hours on end

21:09.200 --> 21:10.480
just to make a single garment.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.830
For the spirit rice you eat,

21:11.830 --> 21:12.790
an entire mu of land

21:12.790 --> 21:14.120
yields but a small bowl.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.550
And this Rainwatch Terrace

21:15.550 --> 21:17.030
cost countless craftsmen's efforts

21:17.030 --> 21:18.240
to build it to completion.

21:18.240 --> 21:20.100
Yet you claim we are the same kind.

21:22.830 --> 21:24.430
You call us kindred spirits,

21:24.790 --> 21:26.270
yet you grow reliant on them

21:26.270 --> 21:27.270
and oppress them.

21:27.440 --> 21:29.070
You are no different from a parasite,

21:29.070 --> 21:29.880
sustaining your own life

21:29.880 --> 21:31.960
by draining the very blood
and flesh of those you look down upon.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.960
Do you want to die?

21:37.710 --> 21:39.230
I knew you'd use this move.

22:16.550 --> 22:17.110
Stop it!

22:44.160 --> 22:44.820
Senior Bai.

22:46.720 --> 22:47.380
Senior Bai.

22:47.920 --> 22:48.980
I'll take you away.

23:21.070 --> 23:22.800
Were you at your full strength,

23:22.960 --> 23:24.620
I might not even be your match.

23:25.200 --> 23:26.920
But you've brought this upon yourself.

23:26.920 --> 23:28.400
Instead of being a War Demon,

23:28.400 --> 23:29.860
you insist on being human.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.000
Don't you know

23:31.270 --> 23:32.600
humans die eventually?

23:32.960 --> 23:34.560
How are you going to fight me?

23:51.160 --> 23:51.960
Xin Xiong,

23:52.720 --> 23:53.850
you gave me your word

23:54.160 --> 23:56.000
never to set foot
in the Tianyuan Sect again.

23:56.000 --> 23:57.000
Five days ago,

23:57.650 --> 23:58.650
a letter

23:58.680 --> 24:00.830
was delivered to Xin Xie Manor.

24:01.350 --> 24:03.010
It was written by my disciple,

24:03.020 --> 24:04.060
Xin Mei,

24:04.480 --> 24:06.350
laying bare the entire truth

24:06.350 --> 24:08.070
of what happened in North Xiang.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.170
After I learnt

24:09.200 --> 24:11.110
the full story behind the Qinghong Sect,

24:11.110 --> 24:13.270
suspicion of you
has taken root in my heart.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.960
Yet I still clung to hope,

24:15.240 --> 24:16.590
unwilling to believe

24:16.590 --> 24:18.350
that Li Mofu—the man who once

24:18.350 --> 24:19.400
bore compassion for all living beings—

24:19.400 --> 24:21.530
could have turned into who you are now.

24:22.160 --> 24:22.880
So,

24:23.270 --> 24:25.930
I hurried to Tianyuan Mountain
that very night,

24:26.350 --> 24:27.790
determined to uncover the truth

24:27.790 --> 24:28.960
with my own eyes.

24:29.750 --> 24:32.150
I kept watch
at the Tianyuan Sect for 4 days,

24:32.270 --> 24:34.800
yet found no trace
of wrongdoing on your part.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.350
I already planned to leave.

24:36.350 --> 24:38.270
I'd already made up my mind to leave,

24:38.270 --> 24:39.880
yet it was right then

24:40.000 --> 24:41.600
that you gave yourself away.

24:43.310 --> 24:44.840
You should never have come.

24:45.110 --> 24:46.370
I shouldn't have come?

24:46.590 --> 24:47.270
Should I just be supposed

24:47.270 --> 24:48.930
to stay fooled by you forever?

24:50.920 --> 24:51.720
Back then,

24:51.880 --> 24:53.310
you somehow obtained

24:53.310 --> 24:55.480
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree
from who knows where,

24:55.480 --> 24:57.200
planted it at the Rainwatch Terrace,

24:57.200 --> 24:59.310
and sought to nurture it to full maturity.

24:59.310 --> 25:00.370
I refused at first.

25:00.600 --> 25:01.600
But you swore to me

25:01.750 --> 25:04.000
you would never
offer human lives as sacrifice;

25:04.000 --> 25:05.960
you'd only let
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree

25:05.960 --> 25:07.920
draw spiritual energy
from Tianyuan Mountain.

25:07.920 --> 25:09.480
Fine! I agreed.

25:10.160 --> 25:12.790
So I left the Tianyuan Sect

25:12.990 --> 25:15.050
and founded a new sect
at the foot of the mountain,

25:15.050 --> 25:15.880
all for one reason:

25:15.880 --> 25:17.680
to keep a close watch over you

25:17.790 --> 25:20.550
and stop you from straying down
a path of no return.

25:20.550 --> 25:22.410
Yet my watch was not tight enough,

25:22.510 --> 25:24.220
and still you went on

25:24.250 --> 25:26.250
to commit unspeakable atrocities!

25:27.440 --> 25:28.600
For everything

25:29.310 --> 25:30.270
I've done,

25:30.680 --> 25:32.140
I have a clear conscience.

25:32.350 --> 25:33.790
Have a clear conscience?

25:34.960 --> 25:37.290
Before the immortal ancestors of the Dao,

25:37.720 --> 25:39.880
before the countless souls

25:39.880 --> 25:42.740
who perished
for the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree,

25:44.720 --> 25:47.000
dare you stand before them

25:47.400 --> 25:48.400
and still claim

25:49.110 --> 25:50.640
your conscience is clear?

25:52.000 --> 25:52.680
Back then,

25:53.510 --> 25:55.960
you too fought in the Battle of Pinghu,

25:56.110 --> 25:58.390
bravely charging into the fray
on the battlefield.

25:58.390 --> 25:59.590
You witnessed firsthand

25:59.590 --> 26:01.850
just how brutal and harrowing it all was!

26:02.830 --> 26:04.070
Why...

26:05.480 --> 26:07.110
Why are you doing this?

26:10.030 --> 26:12.000
All great undertakings in this world

26:12.000 --> 26:12.960
are forged in blood

26:12.960 --> 26:13.820
and sacrifice.

26:14.830 --> 26:15.440
Junior,

26:16.480 --> 26:18.210
you berate and resent me today,

26:19.000 --> 26:20.750
but when the Jianmu Tree
fully matures in time,

26:20.750 --> 26:22.270
its grace will bless all under heaven.

26:22.270 --> 26:23.750
Then you will see

26:24.550 --> 26:26.150
how right my choice truly is.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.480
Senior,

26:29.710 --> 26:31.770
you have strayed down a crooked path,

26:31.990 --> 26:33.790
and there is no turning back now.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.200
Today,

26:35.640 --> 26:37.880
I shall keep the vow I made long ago

26:38.400 --> 26:42.200
and take your life with my own hands.

27:07.310 --> 27:07.920
Xin Xiong,

27:08.680 --> 27:10.640
out of our shared brotherhood
as disciples,

27:10.640 --> 27:12.680
I have held back my blows time and again.

27:12.680 --> 27:14.280
You leave me no other choice.

27:28.960 --> 27:29.550
Sir!

27:56.400 --> 27:56.920
Senior!

27:59.310 --> 27:59.830
Senior!

28:06.350 --> 28:07.030
Junior,

28:08.240 --> 28:09.500
are you satisfied now?

28:09.750 --> 28:10.640
Satisfied?

28:11.110 --> 28:12.680
I'll only be satisfied after you die!

28:12.680 --> 28:13.200
Senior.

28:13.750 --> 28:15.200
We're fellow disciples from the same sect,

28:15.200 --> 28:17.260
and there's no need to strike to kill.

28:18.440 --> 28:20.550
You all knew it long ago, didn't you?

28:21.200 --> 28:22.680
About him cultivating
the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder,

28:22.680 --> 28:24.010
you've known all along!

28:25.160 --> 28:26.440
If I hadn't uncovered

28:26.440 --> 28:27.370
the truth today,

28:27.440 --> 28:29.640
how much longer would you
have kept this hidden from me?

28:29.640 --> 28:31.240
Had we told you sooner,

28:32.830 --> 28:33.640
you would never have let me

28:33.640 --> 28:37.300
bring the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree
back to the Tianyuan Sect.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.480
Senior Mofu speaks the truth.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.590
If the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder is restored,

28:40.590 --> 28:41.990
it will bring immense blessings

28:41.990 --> 28:42.400
to...

28:42.880 --> 28:44.610
all of us cultivators, Senior.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.590
He speaks the truth?

28:47.910 --> 28:49.700
Good for you!

28:50.240 --> 28:52.070
I'll spread this matter

28:52.070 --> 28:53.000
far and wide at once

28:53.000 --> 28:54.200
to let all the great immortal sects

28:54.200 --> 28:55.240
and every living soul under heaven

28:55.240 --> 28:56.400
be the judge.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.720
You nurture
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree

28:58.720 --> 28:59.920
by draining mortal lives—

28:59.920 --> 29:02.160
what kind of righteous reasoning is that?

29:02.160 --> 29:03.160
Stop right there!

29:12.400 --> 29:13.030
Why?

29:13.960 --> 29:15.020
You want to kill me?

29:15.270 --> 29:15.880
Junior,

29:17.480 --> 29:19.200
this is my fault.

29:19.640 --> 29:21.440
If the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree

29:21.440 --> 29:23.370
draws the wrath of the entire world

29:23.590 --> 29:25.680
and brings about Tianyuan Sect's ruin,

29:25.680 --> 29:27.830
a hundred deaths
would not atone for my sins.

29:27.830 --> 29:29.310
If you still insist on

29:29.310 --> 29:30.970
spreading this secret to all,

29:32.000 --> 29:33.510
then strike me down with your own hand.

29:33.510 --> 29:34.910
We are fellow disciples.

29:35.160 --> 29:36.960
Can't we just talk this through?

29:39.640 --> 29:41.100
Must you and I really end up

29:41.960 --> 29:43.790
as bitter enemies like this?

29:44.110 --> 29:45.030
The sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree

29:45.030 --> 29:47.830
is the lifeline
for all cultivators under heaven.

29:47.840 --> 29:49.240
Now that it is in my grasp,

29:50.920 --> 29:52.180
I will never back down.

29:52.760 --> 29:53.680
Senior, put it down!

29:53.680 --> 29:54.680
Don't hurt yourself!

29:54.680 --> 29:56.680
Let's talk this over calmly, Senior!

29:56.680 --> 29:57.510
Senior!

30:09.590 --> 30:10.480
I promise you,

30:12.160 --> 30:14.360
I won't spread this matter to the world.

30:14.920 --> 30:17.780
But you must swear an oath
with me by clapping hands—

30:17.830 --> 30:20.590
you may nurture the sacred seed
and draw spiritual energy,

30:20.590 --> 30:23.240
yet you shall never step foot
beyond Tianyuan Mountain.

30:23.240 --> 30:25.640
Otherwise, I'll never let you off lightly.

30:26.070 --> 30:26.510
Fine.

30:27.110 --> 30:27.910
I promise you.

30:28.070 --> 30:29.070
Second,

30:30.480 --> 30:32.200
I'm moving out of the Tianyuan Sect.

30:32.200 --> 30:33.660
Xin Mei has to come with me.

30:34.030 --> 30:35.760
I want to establish my own sect.

30:36.440 --> 30:37.350
From now on,

30:38.110 --> 30:39.400
I'll sever all ties with you

30:39.400 --> 30:41.440
and with the Tianyuan Sect forever.

30:41.460 --> 30:42.400
Senior, please think twice!

30:42.400 --> 30:42.920
Fine.

30:45.030 --> 30:46.310
I promise you too.

31:01.030 --> 31:02.070
From now on,

31:02.680 --> 31:04.720
I will never step into

31:04.720 --> 31:06.200
the Tianyuan Sect again.

31:06.880 --> 31:08.270
Then you stay and guard

31:08.270 --> 31:09.790
your sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree well.

31:09.790 --> 31:11.390
Step over the line even once,

31:13.190 --> 31:16.700
and do not blame me
for claiming your head.

32:17.070 --> 32:19.000
We'll return to our sect tomorrow.

32:19.440 --> 32:21.100
Having lost his golden lotus,

32:21.200 --> 32:22.750
Jin Lun is as good as crippled.

32:22.750 --> 32:24.550
We must find a way to make amends.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.920
After we meet Master,

32:26.390 --> 32:27.190
we'll decide.

32:31.480 --> 32:33.240
Do you not feel sorrow for him at all?

32:33.240 --> 32:34.370
What's done is done.

32:35.070 --> 32:36.530
Sorrow serves no purpose.

32:36.680 --> 32:38.840
Tianyin Mountain
cultivates the Path of Detachment,

32:38.840 --> 32:40.120
to attain the great Dao

32:40.270 --> 32:41.680
and deliver all living beings.

32:41.680 --> 32:42.310
Senior,

32:42.750 --> 32:44.440
you and I are both living beings.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.770
Jin Lun saved your life,

32:46.510 --> 32:48.170
and in turn saved mine as well.

32:48.270 --> 32:49.930
He traded his own life for two,

32:50.010 --> 32:50.830
which is a worthy exchange.

32:50.830 --> 32:51.400
Sheng,

32:52.350 --> 32:53.610
how could you say that?

33:04.440 --> 33:05.700
You must be very angry,

33:06.830 --> 33:08.290
thinking I'm a bad person.

33:08.830 --> 33:09.830
But truth be told,

33:10.880 --> 33:11.590
I was never much of a good person

33:11.590 --> 33:12.590
to begin with.

33:13.640 --> 33:15.570
Don't speak of yourself like that.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.110
I've long kept a secret hidden

33:17.110 --> 33:18.160
deep in my heart.

33:18.750 --> 33:21.010
In truth, my encounter with you back then

33:21.680 --> 33:23.480
was all carefully planned by me.

33:27.790 --> 33:28.440
Senior.

33:30.270 --> 33:31.350
I've never properly told you

33:31.350 --> 33:32.590
about my past, have I?

33:34.270 --> 33:36.270
Xia Xuanzi was blessed
with extraordinary talent.

33:36.270 --> 33:38.270
He unraveled the mystery of the womb,

33:38.270 --> 33:39.000
forging for himself

33:39.000 --> 33:40.800
an almighty, supreme true form.

33:41.030 --> 33:42.760
Yet powerful as Xia Xuanzi was,

33:42.920 --> 33:44.350
with the heavenly ladder severed,

33:44.350 --> 33:46.010
he lost all path to ascension.

33:46.440 --> 33:47.100
After that,

33:47.550 --> 33:49.680
he believed the Crazy Taoist's prophecy

33:49.680 --> 33:50.720
and set his heart on seizing

33:50.720 --> 33:51.590
the divine fate

33:51.590 --> 33:53.850
destined for one of his own descendants.

33:54.110 --> 33:56.970
He believed the destined descendant
had to be male.

33:57.300 --> 33:59.510
Thus he wielded magic to manipulate fate,

33:59.510 --> 34:02.110
ensuring every child born
in his line was a boy.

34:02.350 --> 34:03.200
I alone

34:03.990 --> 34:05.230
was born a girl.

34:06.440 --> 34:07.640
He thought his magic

34:07.640 --> 34:08.440
had gone awry.

34:09.070 --> 34:10.130
Little did he know,

34:10.670 --> 34:12.110
I too had unraveled

34:13.000 --> 34:15.060
the mystery of the womb just as he had.

34:15.280 --> 34:17.670
I was raised in the Qianyan Cave
from childhood,

34:17.670 --> 34:19.270
reduced to a menial servant,

34:19.510 --> 34:21.230
living a life
of utter humiliation and degradation.

34:21.230 --> 34:23.290
Let my precious one take a small bite.

34:24.480 --> 34:25.760
It won't kill you!

34:26.480 --> 34:27.940
Inside this Qianyan Cave,

34:28.800 --> 34:30.230
we're one.

34:32.000 --> 34:32.920
Misbehave,

34:33.719 --> 34:35.179
and you shall be punished.

34:37.800 --> 34:38.550
Senior,

34:39.480 --> 34:41.080
Qianyan Cave is a demon cave.

34:41.360 --> 34:43.800
The father abandons his duty,
and children forsake theirs.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.030
Everyone is crazy.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.850
When I was young, I made a vow

34:47.480 --> 34:49.320
to burn the Qianyan Cave down.

34:51.070 --> 34:52.110
If the Crazy Taoist's prophecy

34:52.110 --> 34:52.760
is true,

34:54.280 --> 34:55.880
that god must be me.

34:57.280 --> 34:59.080
After all, the Demon God is a god,

34:59.510 --> 35:00.110
right?

35:04.320 --> 35:04.920
Sheng.

35:07.320 --> 35:09.850
You endured
such bitter hardships back then,

35:09.920 --> 35:11.360
yet I never knew a thing.

35:12.670 --> 35:14.200
Why didn't you ever tell me?

35:15.000 --> 35:16.400
There are still many things

35:16.400 --> 35:17.530
I've never told you.

35:18.280 --> 35:20.410
Back then I fled to the Central Plains,

35:20.440 --> 35:22.240
hoping to join an immortal sect.

35:22.800 --> 35:25.440
The Twelve Immortal Sects
held harsh entrance trials.

35:25.440 --> 35:27.300
Only Xin Xie Manor was different.

35:27.880 --> 35:28.840
Xin Xiong was originally

35:28.840 --> 35:30.500
an elder of the Tianyuan Sect,

35:30.710 --> 35:32.550
a cultivator
at the Great Completion Stage.

35:32.550 --> 35:34.210
He was eccentric and erratic,

35:34.880 --> 35:36.810
with only you as his sole disciple.

35:37.030 --> 35:38.760
So I pretended to be bullied,

35:40.000 --> 35:41.800
certain you would take pity on me

35:43.280 --> 35:44.880
and bring me back to the sect.

35:51.000 --> 35:52.150
At first,

35:53.190 --> 35:54.390
Master was wary of me.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.590
Only you

35:57.440 --> 35:58.970
taught me to read and write,

35:59.510 --> 36:00.970
guided me in cultivation,

36:01.190 --> 36:03.120
and passed down martial arts to me.

36:04.760 --> 36:05.510
Senior,

36:07.590 --> 36:09.670
everything I am was taught by you,

36:11.420 --> 36:13.280
all but this wicked heart of mine.

36:18.070 --> 36:18.710
Sheng.

36:20.510 --> 36:22.440
Don't speak of yourself like that.

36:22.510 --> 36:23.070
Sheng,

36:24.280 --> 36:25.150
you're good.

36:26.110 --> 36:27.360
Truly, you are.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.280
Senior,

36:30.190 --> 36:31.150
I will never

36:31.150 --> 36:32.480
do anything to hurt you.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.700
You have to believe me.

36:35.070 --> 36:36.800
I will always believe in you.

36:39.710 --> 36:40.960
I only ache for you

36:42.230 --> 36:44.430
and grieve for all you've been through.

36:51.670 --> 36:52.600
It's just ahead!

37:51.070 --> 37:51.590
Sir,

37:52.230 --> 37:52.890
how are you?

37:53.480 --> 37:55.440
I've cast the Soul-severing Technique,

37:55.440 --> 37:58.040
breaking Li Mofu's
Wandering Soul Technique.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.400
Leave at once.

37:59.550 --> 38:00.360
Take Xin Mei with you

38:00.360 --> 38:01.690
and find a place to hide.

38:02.190 --> 38:03.520
Li Mofu is a man who bears

38:03.840 --> 38:05.150
every slight in mind
and repays every grudge.

38:05.150 --> 38:06.590
He has suffered a crushing defeat

38:06.590 --> 38:08.230
at your hands,

38:08.360 --> 38:09.190
and you nearly destroyed

38:09.190 --> 38:10.900
the sacred seed of the Jianmu Tree.

38:10.900 --> 38:12.760
He will never let you off lightly.

38:14.440 --> 38:14.960
Sir,

38:15.590 --> 38:17.190
let me take you to see Xin Mei.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.760
No need.

38:22.000 --> 38:24.150
I've read her letter

38:24.440 --> 38:26.570
and known everything between you two.

38:27.200 --> 38:29.630
With you by her side, I'm at peace.

38:33.920 --> 38:35.380
I'll take good care of her.

38:36.480 --> 38:39.230
My cultivation is fading away
by the moment.

38:39.630 --> 38:42.320
Rather than letting it go to waste,

38:42.710 --> 38:44.670
I'll give it back to the earth.

38:44.920 --> 38:48.440
Only then may I
wander free and untroubled.

38:53.930 --> 38:55.980
♪ What do you think is ♪

38:56.000 --> 38:58.280
♪ The most impressive farewell
in the world? ♪

38:58.580 --> 39:01.710
♪ The endless slaughter and massacres ♪

39:02.550 --> 39:06.500
♪ Do not wait until that thin snow
on the eaves ♪

39:06.520 --> 39:09.750
♪ Turns a young man's hair white
before you regret it ♪

39:10.300 --> 39:12.040
♪ When do you think ♪

39:12.070 --> 39:14.500
♪ The bloody strife will come to an end? ♪

39:14.520 --> 39:17.850
♪ Burn myself to prove it
without looking back ♪

39:18.400 --> 39:22.370
♪ Holding the morning glow in hand,
I paint the world ♪

39:22.390 --> 39:26.670
♪ Someone's got to clean up this mess ♪

39:47.150 --> 39:47.760
Sheng,

39:48.320 --> 39:48.960
are you up?

39:49.590 --> 39:50.720
It's time we set off.

39:53.960 --> 39:54.510
Sheng?

40:11.920 --> 40:12.520
Landlady,

40:12.920 --> 40:14.050
have you seen Sheng?

40:14.630 --> 40:15.430
No, I haven't.

40:16.190 --> 40:17.040
Honestly,

40:17.070 --> 40:18.320
she's all grown up now.

40:18.320 --> 40:18.800
Must you worry about her

40:18.800 --> 40:20.150
every single day?

40:20.440 --> 40:22.300
I'd better go look for her anyway.

40:22.400 --> 40:22.880
Xin Mei.

40:23.760 --> 40:24.890
Has Lu come back yet?

40:25.550 --> 40:26.550
No, he's not here.

40:26.630 --> 40:27.510
Didn't he go to Chongling Valley

40:27.510 --> 40:28.670
to undergo the heart transformation?

40:28.670 --> 40:30.880
Grandmaster never returned
to the valley at all.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.440
What?

40:31.840 --> 40:32.900
Lu's gone missing.

40:33.110 --> 40:34.400
He put me under a spell
and knocked me out.

40:34.400 --> 40:35.000
When I woke up,

40:35.000 --> 40:36.320
I headed straight for Chongling Valley,

40:36.320 --> 40:38.380
only to find he never showed up there.

40:38.670 --> 40:39.230
So

40:39.480 --> 40:40.590
we couldn't stop worrying

40:40.590 --> 40:41.800
and came along here.

40:43.630 --> 40:44.230
Landlady,

40:44.960 --> 40:46.090
what month is it now?

40:46.110 --> 40:47.000
Why have all the flowers outside

40:47.000 --> 40:48.060
suddenly bloomed?

40:49.400 --> 40:50.000
It's true.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.770
We hurried back and didn't notice.

40:55.440 --> 40:57.440
A cultivator at the Great Completion Stage
is dissipating their cultivation.
